menu "Project feature configuration"

config AIP1620_POWER_TEST
    bool "Enable AiP1620 power-test console"
    default n
    help
        Compile the application-layer UART power-test task.
        Keep this disabled in production firmware.

config SLEEP_RECORD_UART_TEST
    bool "Enable sleep-record UART test console"
    default y
    depends on !AIP1620_POWER_TEST
    help
        Enable the development-only UART commands for exercising the
        App_SleepRecord state machine. Disable this in production firmware.
        This option and AIP1620_POWER_TEST cannot share console UART0.

endmenu
